ns unexpected content</li>\n            <li>Preserve remaining content after extraction</li>\n            <li>Add regression fixture and test coverage</li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 dir=\"auto\">Testing</h2>\n          <ul dir=\"auto\">\n            <li><code class=\"notranslate\">npm test</code></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </task-lists>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Code review comment -->\n<div class=\"js-inline-comments-container\">\n  <div class=\"js-comments-holder\">\n    <div id=\"discussion_r3001\" class=\"timeline-comment-group js-minimizable-comment-group my-0 comment js-comment review-comment unminimized-comment\">\n      <div class=\"ml-n1 clearfix d-flex\">\n        <h3 class=\"f5 text-normal d-flex\">\n          <strong class=\"ml-1\">\n            <a class=\"author Link--primary text-bold\" href=\"/reviewer-bot\">reviewer-bot</a>\n          </strong>\n          <a href=\"#discussion_r3001\" class=\"Link--secondary js-timestamp\">\n            <relative-time datetime=\"2026-01-15T10:45:00Z\" class=\"no-wrap\">Jan 15, 2026</relative-time>\n          </a>\n        </h3>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tmp-ml-5\">\n        <div class=\"edit-comment-hide\">\n          <task-lists disabled=\"\" sortable=\"\">\n            <div class=\"comment-body markdown-body js-comment-body soft-wrap d-block\">\n              <p dir=\"auto\">Consider removing just the image element instead of the entire anchor, to preserve any text content inside the link.</p>\n            </div>\n          </task-lists>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Another code review comment -->\n<div class=\"js-inline-comments-container\">\n  <div class=\"js-comments-holder\">\n    <div id=\"discussion_r3002\" class=\"timeline-comment-group js-minimizable-comment-group my-0 comment js-comment review-comment unminimized-comment\">\n      <div class=\"ml-n1 clearfix d-flex\">\n        <h3 class=\"f5 text-normal d-flex\">\n          