        <li>Preserve linked text when stripping the image</li>\n                <li>Check for block-level content instead of early return</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
